Kernel 7.3 hands the cookie for remain_on_channel, mgmt_tx and the renamed
probe_peer to the driver instead of asking the driver for one. The driver
keeps that cookie with the request and reports it back on ready, expiry,
tx status and probe status. cfg80211_probe_status also takes the link id,
which is -1 without MLO.
